OL,3,GNEWSAWoman hit by e-bike calls for more
OL,4,Apolice action
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those to have felt the impact of
OL,7,Fe-bikes is Christina Marchand, who
OL,8,Fbelieves the issue is "just as bad" as
OL,9,Fwhen an electric bike crashed into her
OL,10,Falmost two years ago and says police
OL,11,F"should take more action".
